/-!
# The A₅ quotient family and source normalizer action

The original marked source action yields the four-member maximum
elementary family for every quotient with kernel between Φ(D) and D.
For the actual S/Φ(D), the proved block stabilizer identity singles out
the core pair. This proves the even-order assertion and constructs the
Sylow replacement required by C.5.6(5)–(6), pp.157–158.
-/
